sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Khách hàng
    actor S as Nhân viên
    participant FE as business-store-frontend
    participant C as PhotobookProjectController
    participant P as PhotobookProjectServiceImpl
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant M as CloudinaryMediaStorageService
    participant CL as Cloudinary
    participant N as NotificationServiceImpl
    U->>FE: Tải ảnh và submit cuốn photobook
    FE->>C: POST /api/v1/photobook-projects/{id}/photos (multipart/HTTPS)
    C->>P: addPhoto(userId, id, file)
    P->>M: uploadPhotobookPhoto
    M->>CL: Upload ảnh private (HTTPS API)
    CL-->>M: publicId / secureUrl
    P->>DB: Ghi PhotobookProjectPhoto (JPA/JDBC)
    FE->>C: POST /api/v1/photobook-projects/{id}/submit (JSON/HTTPS)
    C->>P: submit(userId, id, note)
    P->>DB: Ghi status PHOTOS_SUBMITTED và spreads
    S->>FE: Tải proof
    FE->>C: POST /api/v1/photobook-projects/{id}/proofs (multipart/HTTPS)
    C->>P: uploadProof(staffId, id, file, note)
    P->>M: uploadPhotobookProof
    M->>CL: Upload proof private (HTTPS API)
    P->>DB: Ghi PhotobookProof, status PROOF_SENT
    P->>N: Tạo notification proof đã sẵn sàng
    U->>C: PUT /api/v1/photobook-projects/{id}/proof-decision (JSON/HTTPS)
    C->>P: decideProof(userId, id, approved, note)
    P->>DB: APPROVED hoặc REVISION_REQUESTED
